#: src/ui/settings.rs:2686
msgid "When Sirensong custom order and your Spotify library were both rearranged apart: show both and choose, take Spotify's, or keep this computer's and send it to Spotify."
msgstr "當 Sirensong 自訂順序和你的 Spotify 音樂庫分別被重新排列時：顯示兩邊並選擇、採用 Spotify 的，或保留這台電腦的並傳送到 Spotify。"

#. Translators: When both orders changed: show both and choose each time.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2705
msgid "Ask me"
msgstr "詢問我"

#. Translators: When both orders changed: take the Spotify library's.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2707
msgid "Spotify's"
msgstr "Spotify 的"

#. Translators: When both orders changed: keep Sirensong custom order.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2709
msgid "Mine"
msgstr "我的"

#. Translators: {name} is a folder name in Sirensong custom order.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:67
msgid "“{name}” will be removed from Sirensong custom order. What it holds stays where it is."
msgstr "「{name}」將從 Sirensong 自訂順序中移除。其中的內容保持原位。"

#. Translators: Sirensong custom order and the Spotify library were both rearranged while apart.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:98
msgid "Both orders changed"
msgstr "兩邊的順序都有變更"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:100
msgid "Sirensong custom order and your Spotify library were rearranged apart. Choose which to keep: the other follows it. What only Sirensong arranges stays either way."
msgstr "Sirensong 自訂順序和你的 Spotify 音樂庫被分別重新排列了。選擇保留哪一個：另一個會隨之變更。只由 Sirensong 排列的內容無論如何都會保留。"

#. Translators: Heading over what changed in the Spotify library.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:112
msgid "On Spotify"
msgstr "Spotify 上"

#. Translators: Heading over what changed in Sirensong custom order.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:114
msgid "In Sirensong"
msgstr "Sirensong 中"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:119
msgid "No changes"
msgstr "沒有變更"

#. Translators: Keep Sirensong custom order and send it to Spotify.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:151
msgid "Keep mine"
msgstr "保留我的"

#. Translators: Take the Spotify library's arrangement into Sirensong custom order.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:155
msgid "Use Spotify's"
msgstr "採用 Spotify 的"

#. Translators: A line of the conflict dialog. {name} is a playlist or folder, {folder} the folder it moved into.
#: src/app.rs:6872
msgid "{name} moved into {folder}"
msgstr "{name} 已移入 {folder}"

#. Translators: A line of the conflict dialog. {name} is a playlist or folder that moved, outside any folder.
#: src/app.rs:6878
msgid "{name} moved"
msgstr "{name} 已移動"

#. Translators: A line of the conflict dialog. {name} is a playlist or folder that was added.
#: src/app.rs:6882
msgid "{name} added"
msgstr "{name} 已新增"

#. Translators: A line of the conflict dialog. {name} is a playlist or folder that was removed.
#: src/app.rs:6886
msgid "{name} removed"
msgstr "{name} 已移除"

#. Translators: A line of the conflict dialog. {name} is the folder's new name.
#: src/app.rs:6889
msgid "Folder renamed to {name}"
msgstr "資料夾已重新命名為 {name}"

#. Translators: A setting: choosing Tree or Circles for the playlist map chooses it on Home and in the Library both.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1349
msgid "Same map view on Home and in the Library"
msgstr "首頁和音樂庫使用相同的地圖檢視"

#. Translators: A setting: while Home shows the playlist map, the Library shows its list or grid instead of a second map.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1351
msgid "One map at a time"
msgstr "一次只顯示一個地圖"

#. Translators: A setting: which results a new search shows first, all mixed or one kind.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1353
msgid "Search opens on"
msgstr "搜尋首先顯示"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1503
msgid "Off, Home's map and the Library's each keep their own choice of Tree or Circles."
msgstr "關閉時，首頁的地圖和音樂庫的地圖各自保留樹狀或圓圈的選擇。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1510
msgid "While Home shows the map, the Library shows its list or grid."
msgstr "首頁顯示地圖時，音樂庫顯示為清單或格狀。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1517
msgid "The results a new search shows first: all of them, or one kind."
msgstr "新搜尋首先顯示的結果：全部，或某一類。"

#. Translators: Player bar visualizer: the spectrum and the waveform together.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1790
msgid "Both"
msgstr "兩者"

#. Translators: Hover text on the Library's map views while Home shows the playlist map, with one map at a time.
#: src/ui/sidebar.rs:2442
msgid "Home shows the map now"
msgstr "首頁正在顯示地圖"

#. Translators: A setting: while the playlist map is open, the Library's search box sits above the map.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1355
msgid "Search box above the map"
msgstr "地圖上方的搜尋框"

#. Translators: A setting: searching marks what matches on the playlist map instead of filtering it.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1357
msgid "Search marks matches on the map"
msgstr "搜尋在地圖上標出相符項目"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1528
msgid "While a map is open, the Library's search box sits above it."
msgstr "地圖開啟時，音樂庫的搜尋框位於地圖上方。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1535
msgid "Searching rings what matches and leaves the rest in place. Off, the search is a filter, as Zoom in and Only selected treat the others."
msgstr "搜尋會圈出相符項目，其餘保持原位。關閉時，搜尋是一個篩選條件，放大和僅所選會像對待其他篩選條件一樣對待它。"

#. Translators: A settings section: how songs play, on this computer or through Spotify Soloist.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:739
msgid "Playback"
msgstr "播放"

#. Translators: A settings section: the equalizer, which shapes the sound.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1475
msgid "Sound"
msgstr "聲音"

#. Translators: A settings section: the playlist map on Home and in the Library, and what Home suggests.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1477
msgid "Home and map"
msgstr "首頁和地圖"

#. Translators: A settings section: the player bar visualizer and MilkDrop.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1481
msgid "Visualizers"
msgstr "視覺化"

#. Translators: A settings section: the window, the tray, starting with the computer, and updates.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1483
msgid "Window and system"
msgstr "視窗和系統"

#. Translators: A settings section: the proxy for network requests.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1485
msgid "Network"
msgstr "網路"

#. Translators: Under a greyed-out setting. {setting} is the name of the setting it depends on.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:182
msgid "Needs {setting}."
msgstr "需要「{setting}」。"

#. Translators: Under a greyed-out setting. {setting} is the name of the setting that turns it off.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:190
msgid "Off while {setting} is on."
msgstr "「{setting}」開啟時關閉。"

#. Translators: Under a greyed-out setting. {setting} is a setting's name and {choice} one of its choices.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:202
msgid "Needs {setting} set to {choice}."
msgstr "需要將「{setting}」設為「{choice}」。"

#. Translators: A playlist chosen to add to another one turned out to hold no songs.
#: src/app.rs:13496
msgid "That playlist has no songs to add"
msgstr "該播放清單中沒有可新增的歌曲"

#. Translators: A settings section named for the Funnel projects (one thing at a time, nothing suggested), of which Sirensong's "Only what I ask for" is a part. Funnel is a name: keep it as it is.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1548
msgid "Funnel"
msgstr "Funnel"

#. Translators: A small link under the Funnel settings: the Funnel browser extension. Funnel is a name.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2262
msgid "Funnel for Firefox"
msgstr "Funnel Firefox 版"

#. Translators: A small label under the Funnel settings: the Funnel Android app, which has no page to link to yet. Funnel is a name.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2278
msgid "Funnel for Android"
msgstr "Funnel Android 版"

#. Translators: A setting: keep the results of every search on this computer.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:949
msgid "Keep a search log"
msgstr "保留搜尋紀錄"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1603
msgid "Keeps what every search showed, on this computer only, for the last 1,000 searches. Nothing is uploaded."
msgstr "僅在這台電腦上保存每次搜尋顯示的結果，最多保留最近 1,000 次搜尋。不會上傳任何內容。"
